        70.86609649658203,
        89.09461212158203,
        527.37841796875,
        103.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "Regarding PICO question 8–2019 (MDR/RR-TB, 2019), the analysis yielded aORs of 1.5 (95% CI: 0.7–2.7)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
