        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.4266357421875,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "for treatment success versus failure, 0.8 (95% CI: 0.2–0.4) for treatment success versus death, 1.0",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.2235717773438,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 0.5–1.7) for treatment success versus failure or death, and 0.8 (95% CI: 0.5–1.2) for treatment",
