      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.3883056640625,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "the people who received bedaquiline for >6 months were likely to have done so because of clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4068603515625,
        248.73768615722656
